{"id":"group-anagram-words","version":1,"status":"approved","title":"Group Rearranged Words","summary":"Collect words with identical letter inventories.","statement":"Group words that are anagrams. Group order and word order inside groups do not matter.","constraints":["0 <= len(words) <= 10,000","Words contain lowercase English letters."],"topics":["hash-maps","strings"],"prerequisites":["hash-maps"],"signature":{"name":"group_anagram_words","parameters":[{"name":"words","annotation":"list[str]","adapter":"raw","source_parameter":null}],"returns":"list[list[str]]","return_adapter":"raw","node_policy":"values","result_mode":"return","mutated_parameter":null,"immutable_parameters":[]},"starter_code":"def group_anagram_words(words: list[str]) -> list[list[str]]:\n    # Write your solution here.\n    pass\n","reference_solution":"def group_anagram_words(words):\n    groups = defaultdict(list)\n    for word in words:\n        groups[tuple(sorted(word))].append(word)\n    return list(groups.values())\n","brute_force_solution":"def group_anagram_words(words):\n    groups = defaultdict(list)\n    for word in words:\n        groups[tuple(sorted(word))].append(word)\n    return list(groups.values())\n","known_wrong_solutions":["def group_anagram_words(words):\n    return None\n","def group_anagram_words(words):\n    return 0\n"],"target_time_complexity":"O(n · k log k)","target_space_complexity":"O(n · k)","estimated_minutes":25,"rubric":{"algorithmic_insight":2,"prerequisites":1,"implementation":1,"performance_pressure":0,"edge_cases":0},"hints":["Anagrams share a canonical representation.","A sorted word can serve as a hashable key.","Map each tuple(sorted(word)) to the words having that key.","Return the collected dictionary values."],"editorial":"Canonicalize each word by sorting its letters, then group words sharing that key.","tests":[{"id":"group-anagram-words-case-1","arguments":[["eat","tea","tan","ate","nat","bat"]],"expected":[["eat","tea","ate"],["tan","nat"],["b